The repository-local [file doc/tcl/config-parameters.tcl] is authoritative for the
parameters below. Generate the committed include with [const {make regen-config-parameters-includes}].
[const {make check-doc}] checks freshness and validates the complete manual.
[const {make build-doc}] creates standalone HTML and nroff documentation.
For the complete web-interface guide, see
[uri https://github.com/naviserver-project/nsstats/blob/main/README.md {the repository README}].
